1. Supabase Triggers
Universal triggers:

booking.created

booking.status_changed

dispute.created

dispute.resolved

settlement.created

reward.minted

governance.proposal.created

governance.vote.cast

profile.updated

governance.policy.updated

2. Workers
Workers listen to Layer‑1 events:

sync_chain_events.ts

sync_settlements.ts

sync_disputes.ts

sync_rewards.ts

Workers write to Supabase and emit realtime events.

3. Realtime
Supabase realtime broadcasts:

booking updates

dispute updates

settlement updates

reward updates

governance updates

Mobile + Web apps subscribe via EventSource.
